#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1140
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadYoureHereWithYourPokemon"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hm?\p"
"Well, if it isn't {PLAYER}!\n"
"So you're all finished moving in?\p"
"I'm surprised that you managed to\n"
"get here by yourself.\p"
"Oh, I see.\n"
"You're with your POKéMON.\p"
"Hm… Then I guess you're going to\n"
"become a TRAINER like me, {PLAYER}.\p"
"That's great news!\n"
"I'll be looking forward to it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1153
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIdLikeAPokemon"
msgid ""
"Um… I…\n"
"I'd like to get a POKéMON, please…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1157
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadOhYoureWallyRight"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hm? You're… Uh… Oh, right.\n"
"You're WALLY, right?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1161
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyIveNeverCaughtAPokemon"
msgid ""
"WALLY: I'm going to go stay with my\n"
"relatives in VERDANTURF TOWN.\p"
"I thought I would be lonely by myself,\n"
"so I wanted to take a POKéMON along.\p"
"But I've never caught a POKéMON before.\n"
"I don't know how…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1169
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHmISee"
msgid "DAD: Hm. I see.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1172
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadPlayerGoWithWally"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}, you heard that,\n"
"right?\p"
"Go with WALLY and make sure that he\n"
"safely catches a POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1178
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_IllLoanYouMyZigzagoon"
msgid ""
"WALLY, here, I'll loan you my POKéMON.\p"
"WALLY received a ZIGZAGOON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1182
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouAndDadGivesPokeBall"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Oh, wow!\n"
"A POKéMON!\p"
"DAD: Hm. I'll give you a POKé BALL, too.\n"
"Go for it!\p"
"WALLY received a POKé BALL!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1189
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyOhWowThankYou"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Oh, wow!\n"
"Thank you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1193
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WouldYouReallyComeWithMe"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}… Would you really come\n"
"with me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1197
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadSoDidItWorkOut"
msgid "DAD: So, did it work out?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1200
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_WallyThankYouBye"
msgid ""
"WALLY: Thank you, yes, it did.\n"
"Here's your POKéMON back.\p"
"{PLAYER}, thank you for coming along\n"
"with me.\p"
"You two are why I was able to catch\n"
"my POKéMON.\p"
"I promise I'll take really good\n"
"care of it.\p"
"Oh! My mom's waiting for me,\n"
"so I have to go!\p"
"Bye, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1213
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoCollectBadges"
msgid ""
"DAD: Now…\p"
"{PLAYER}, if you want to become a\n"
"strong TRAINER, here's my advice.\p"
"Head for RUSTBORO CITY beyond this\n"
"town.\p"
"There, you should challenge\n"
"the GYM LEADER, ROXANNE.\p"
"After her, go on to other POKéMON\n"
"GYMS and defeat their LEADERS.\p"
"Collect BADGES from them,\n"
"understood?\p"
"Of course, I'm a GYM LEADER, too.\n"
"We'll battle one day, {PLAYER}.\p"
"But that's only after you become\n"
"stronger.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1230
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToRustboro"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hm? Aren't you going to the\n"
"POKéMON GYM in RUSTBORO CITY?\p"
"There's no challenge for me to\n"
"battle a greenhorn TRAINER.\p"
"{PLAYER}, I want you to challenge me\n"
"when you become a lot stronger.\p"
"I'll battle you, {PLAYER}, when you\n"
"can show me four GYM BADGES, okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1240
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanGoToDewford"
msgid ""
"DAD: I see… So, you've beaten\n"
"the GYM LEADER in RUSTBORO CITY.\p"
"But there are many more TRAINERS\n"
"who are stronger than you, {PLAYER}.\p"
"Across the sea in DEWFORD TOWN is a\n"
"GYM LEADER named BRAWLY.\p"
"You should go challenge him.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1249
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_YouHaveGottenStronger"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hm… {PLAYER}, you have gotten\n"
"stronger.\p"
"I can tell by the number of BADGES\n"
"that you've earned.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1255
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanIntro"
msgid ""
"DAD: Hm…\n"
"So, you did get four GYM BADGES.\p"
"Fine, as I promised, we will have\n"
"a POKéMON battle.\p"
"{PLAYER}…\p"
"I'm so happy that I can have\n"
"a real battle with my own child.\p"
"But, a battle is a battle!\p"
"I will do everything in my power as\n"
"a GYM LEADER to win.\p"
"{PLAYER}, you'd better give it your\n"
"best shot, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1269
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanDefeat"
msgid ""
"…\p"
"I… I can't…\p"
"I can't believe it. {PLAYER}…\p"
"I lost to {PLAYER}?\p"
"But, rules are rules!\n"
"Here, take this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1277
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedBalanceBadge"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the BALANCE BADGE\n"
"from DAD!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1281
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ExplainBalanceBadgeTakeThis"
msgid ""
"DAD: With that BADGE, the DEFENSE\n"
"of all your POKéMON will increase.\p"
"POKéMON that know the HM move SURF\n"
"will be able to travel over water.\p"
"This is my gift to you. {PLAYER}, I'm\n"
"sure you can use it correctly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1289
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ExplainFacade"
msgid ""
"DAD: TM42 contains FACADE.\p"
"It doubles the power of moves if\n"
"the POKéMON is poisoned, paralyzed,\l"
"or burned.\p"
"It might be able to turn a bad\n"
"situation into an advantage.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1297
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadHappyAndSad"
msgid ""
"DAD: As the GYM LEADER, I can't\n"
"express how upset I am…\p"
"But as a father, it makes me both\n"
"happy and a little sad. It's odd…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1303
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_PleaseComeWithMe"
msgid ""
"Ah, there you are, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Please come with me.\n"
"I have something I want you to have.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1308
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_LetMeBorrowPlayer"
msgid ""
"NORMAN, you don't mind, do you?\p"
"Let me borrow your {PLAYER}{KUN} for\n"
"a minute or two.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1313
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadGoingToKeepTraining"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}, you should go visit\n"
"your mother every so often.\p"
"I'm going to stay here and redouble\n"
"my training.\p"
"It would bother me as a TRAINER to\n"
"not avenge my loss to you, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1321
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DadNoAmountOfTrainingIsEnough"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}, how are things going?\p"
"The world of POKéMON is deep.\p"
"I honestly think that no amount of\n"
"training would ever be enough.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1327
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice"
msgid ""
"Hey, how's it going, CHAMPION-\n"
"bound {PLAYER}?\p"
"The doors in this GYM open when you\n"
"beat the awaiting TRAINERS.\p"
"Whoops! The doors in this room are\n"
"already open, so don't attack me!\p"
"The TRAINERS of PETALBURG GYM\n"
"use all kinds of items.\p"
"The door at the left leads to\n"
"the SPEED ROOM.\p"
"The door at the right leads to\n"
"the ACCURACY ROOM.\p"
"The room's name will be on\n"
"the door, so choose carefully.\p"
"Once you've chosen the door…\n"
"Well, hey, go for it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1345
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}! Whoa! You've overcome even\n"
"your own father!\p"
"Like, whoa!\n"
"What a stunning turn of events!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1351
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallIntro"
msgid ""
"The ability to attack before the\n"
"opponent…\p"
"Just that alone puts me at a great\n"
"advantage, don't you agree?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1357
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallDefeat"
msgid "That was a magnificent battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1360
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Go on to the next room where a new\n"
"challenge awaits you.\p"
"At the left is the CONFUSION ROOM.\p"
"The right door leads to the DEFENSE\n"
"ROOM.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1367
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_RandallPostBadge"
msgid ""
"Whomever you beat, and whomever you\n"
"may lose to, you never shirk from\l"
"training yourself and your POKéMON.\p"
"That's what I think being a\n"
"GYM LEADER is all about.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1374
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerIntro"
msgid ""
"This is the CONFUSION ROOM.\p"
"Let me see how well bonded you are\n"
"with your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1379
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerDefeat"
msgid ""
"I couldn't confuse your team enough…\n"
"You share a strong bond together.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1383
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The next room is the STRENGTH ROOM.\n"
"Can you withstand brute force?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1387
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_ParkerPostBadge"
msgid ""
"After you beat our LEADER, the\n"
"training has become a lot tougher.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1391
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgeIntro"
msgid ""
"Just when you think you're going to\n"
"win, your opponent restores HP…\p"
"Can you just imagine how awful that\n"
"must feel?\p"
"I'll show you exactly how awful it\n"
"feels!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1399
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgeDefeat"
msgid ""
"I couldn't restore HP enough…\n"
"What ATTACK power…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1403
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I should have expected no less from\n"
"our LEADER's kid.\p"
"No, wait! A TRAINER's abilities are\n"
"earned only through effort.\p"
"I lost because my own efforts\n"
"weren't enough.\p"
"Go on! The ONE-HIT KO ROOM is next.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1412
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GeorgePostBadge"
msgid ""
"I'm going to keep training at GYMS.\n"
"One day, I'll become a LEADER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1416
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkeIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm not going to take it easy just\n"
"because you're our LEADER's kid.\p"
"I'll show you how horrid it is for\n"
"a POKéMON to take a critical hit!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1422
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkeDefeat"
msgid ""
"Your power…\n"
"You're the real deal.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1426
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your father really is strong.\n"
"He's a TRAINER worth my respect.\p"
"And, I sense the same glow coming\n"
"from you as your father.\p"
"I hope that you'll stage a terrific\n"
"battle with your father!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1434
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_BerkePostBadge"
msgid ""
"Since your dad became the LEADER,\n"
"the TRAINERS of PETALBURG CITY have\l"
"become a lot tougher.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1439
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryIntro"
msgid ""
"Giggle…\n"
"This is the ACCURACY ROOM.\p"
"It's pretty nasty when every attack\n"
"lands without fail.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1445
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryDefeat"
msgid "You were a cut above me…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1448
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There are some even stronger\n"
"TRAINERS waiting for you.\p"
"The left is the DEFENSE ROOM, and\n"
"the right is the RECOVERY ROOM.\p"
"Your POKéMON's ATTACK power will be\n"
"on trial either way.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1456
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_MaryPostBadge"
msgid ""
"Do you know what we're trying to\n"
"achieve as TRAINERS?\p"
"We're striving to become soul mates\n"
"with our POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1462
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaIntro"
msgid ""
"The higher the DEFENSE, the more\n"
"reckless I can be in attack.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1466
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaDefeat"
msgid "Our defenses weren't enough…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1469
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think you've taught me a valuable\n"
"lesson here.\p"
"Now, go on! The left door goes to\n"
"the STRENGTH ROOM.\p"
"The right door opens to\n"
"the ONE-HIT KO ROOM.\p"
"Both of them have TRAINERS who are\n"
"skilled at offense.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1479
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_AlexiaPostBadge"
msgid "Hi! Have you tried using SURF?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1482
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyIntro"
msgid ""
"Our GYM LEADER told us to go all out\n"
"and beat you.\p"
"Even if you happen to be the\n"
"LEADER's kid!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1488
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyDefeat"
msgid "But… I went all out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1491
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The way you use your POKéMON…\n"
"It's like your father's style.\p"
"Go on through! The GYM LEADER, your\n"
"father, is waiting!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1497
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_JodyPostBadge"
msgid ""
"Sure, it's fine to make your POKéMON\n"
"stronger.\p"
"But what decides the winner?\p"
"Why, it's the feelings TRAINERS have\n"
"for their POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1504
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DoorAppearsLocked"
msgid ""
"This door appears to be locked\n"
"right now…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1508
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterSpeedRoom"
msgid ""
"“SPEED ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1513
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_DoorAppearsLocked2"
msgid ""
"This door appears to be locked\n"
"right now…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1517
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterAccuracyRoom"
msgid ""
"“ACCURACY ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1521
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterConfusionRoom"
msgid ""
"“CONFUSION ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1525
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterDefenseRoom"
msgid ""
"“DEFENSE ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1529
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterRecoveryRoom"
msgid ""
"“RECOVERY ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1533
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterStrengthRoom"
msgid ""
"“STRENGTH ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1537
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterOHKORoom"
msgid ""
"“ONE-HIT KO ROOM,” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1541
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_EnterGymLeadersRoom"
msgid ""
"“GYM LEADER'S ROOM\p"
"“See for yourself what POKéMON await\n"
"you!” the sign says.\p"
"Do you want to go through?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1547
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue"
msgid "PETALBURG CITY POKéMON GYM$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1550
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified"
msgid ""
"PETALBURG CITY POKéMON GYM\p"
"NORMAN'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
"{PLAYER}$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1555
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanPreRematch"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}…\n"
"I had a feeling that you would come.\p"
"I would never refuse to accept\n"
"a challenge from you.\p"
"You do understand, don't you?\p"
"Inside a GYM, it doesn't matter that\n"
"we are a parent and child.\p"
"…No, because we are parent and child,\n"
"we owe it to each other to do the best\l"
"we can. Isn't that right, {PLAYER}?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1567
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Uh… Haha…\n"
"Maybe that was going too hard…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1571
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanPostRematch"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}…\n"
"What is your dream?\p"
"My dream…\n"
"Hahaha…\l"
"It has already come true, actually.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_Gym/scripts.inc:1578
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Gym_Text_NormanRematchNeedTwoMons"
msgid ""
"DAD: {PLAYER}…\n"
"I had a feeling that you would come.\p"
"I would never refuse to accept\n"
"a challenge from you.\p"
"You do understand, don't you?\p"
"Inside a GYM, it doesn't matter that\n"
"we are a parent and child.\p"
"Hm? Wait a second, {PLAYER}.\p"
"Do you only have one POKéMON that is\n"
"capable of battle?\p"
"Sorry, but you'll have to come back\n"
"with at least two POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
